"Indicates whether the user wishes to see syntax highlighting in the diffs."
msgstr "指出用户是否希望在 diff 文件中看到语法高亮显示。"

#: accounts/models.py:72
msgid "profile private"
msgstr "个人资料保密"

#: accounts/models.py:73
