#: admin/security_checks.py:37
msgid ""
"A misconfiguration in the web server can cause files attached to review "
"requests to be executed as code. The file types checked in this test are: ."
"html, .htm, .shtml, .php, .php3, .php4, .php5, .phps, .asp, .pl, .py, ."
"fcgi, .cgi, .phtml, .pht, .jsp, .sh, and .rb."
msgstr ""
"Web 服务器配置不当可能导致附加到评审请求的文件被作为代码执行。此测试检查的文件类型包括：.html、.htm、.shtml、.php、.php3、.php4、.php5、.phps、.asp、.pl、.py、.fcgi、.cgi、.phtml、.pht、.jsp、.sh 和 .rb。"

#: admin/security_checks.py:42
msgid ""
"For instructions on how to fix this problem, please visit <a href=\"http://"
"support.beanbaginc.com/support/solutions/articles/110173-securing-file-"
"attachments\">http://support.beanbaginc.com/support/solutions/"
"articles/110173-securing-file-attachments</a>"
msgstr ""
"有关如何修复此问题的说明，请访问 <a href=\"http://support.beanbaginc.com/support/solutions/articles/110173-securing-file-attachments\">http://support.beanbaginc.com/support/solutions/articles/110173-securing-file-attachments</a>"

#: admin/security_checks.py:117
#, python-format
msgid "Uncaught exception during test: %s"
msgstr "测试过程中捕获到异常：%s"

#: admin/security_checks.py:125
#, python-format
msgid "The web server incorrectly executed these file types: %s"
msgid_plural "The web server incorrectly executed this file type: %s"
msgstr[0] "Web 服务器错误地执行了这些文件类型：%s"

#: admin/security_checks.py:128
msgid ", "
msgstr ""

#: admin/security_checks.py:149
msgid "Checking ALLOWED_HOSTS setting"
msgstr "检查 ALLOWED_HOSTS 设置"

#: admin/security_checks.py:150
msgid ""
"ALLOWED_HOSTS is a list containing the host/domain names that Review Board "
"will consider valid for this server to serve. This is a security measure to "
"prevent an attacker from poisoning cache and password reset emails with "
"links to malicious hosts by submitting requests with a fake HTTP Host "
"header, which is possible even under many seemingly-safe web server "
"configurations."
msgstr "ALLOWED_HOSTS 是一个包含 Review Board 服务器将视为有效的主机/域名的列表。这是一项安全措施，用于防止攻击者通过提交带有虚假 HTTP Host 头的请求，用恶意主机链接污染缓存和密码重置电子邮件，这种情况即使在许多看似安全的 Web 服务器配置下也可能发生。"

#: admin/security_checks.py:157
msgid ""
"To fix this, edit the settings_local.py in the site's conf directory and add "
"a line like this with your site's URL: <pre>ALLOWED_HOSTS = ['example.com']</"
"pre>"
msgstr "要修复此问题，请编辑站点 conf 目录中的 settings_local.py 文件，并添加一行包含您站点 URL 的配置，例如：<pre>ALLOWED_HOSTS = ['example.com']</pre>"

#: admin/security_checks.py:167
msgid "ALLOWED_HOSTS is empty."
msgstr "ALLOWED_HOSTS 为空。"

#: admin/security_checks.py:171
msgid ""
"ALLOWED_HOSTS contains '*', which means that the server will respond to any "
"host."
msgstr "ALLOWED_HOSTS 包含 '*'，这意味着服务器将响应任何主机。"

#: admin/validation.py:23
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%s has invalid format specification type(s). Use only one '%%s' to mark the "
"location of the bug id. If the URI contains encoded values (e.g. '%%20'), "
"prepend the encoded values with an additional '%%'."
msgstr "%s 包含无效的格式规范类型。仅使用一个 '%%s' 来标记 bug ID 的位置。如果 URI 包含编码值（例如 '%%20'），请在编码值前添加额外的 '%%'。"

